# .trivyignore
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The CVEs below are reported from npm's internal dependency tree in the base
# Node image, not from application runtime dependencies.
#
# The nexOOS Dockerfile removes the globally bundled npm/npx from the runtime
# image after installing production dependencies, so these findings do not
# represent packages used by the running application container.
#
# App dependency verification should still be handled by npm audit and lockfile
# updates; this file is only for container-scan false positives from npm internals.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# cross-spawn: ReDoS in npm internal dependency metadata
CVE-2024-21538

# glob: command injection in npm internal dependency metadata
CVE-2025-64756

# minimatch: DoS via crafted glob in npm internal dependency metadata
CVE-2026-26996
CVE-2026-27903
CVE-2026-27904

# tar: path traversal / file overwrite in npm internal dependency metadata
CVE-2026-23745
CVE-2026-23950
CVE-2026-24842
CVE-2026-26960
CVE-2026-29786
CVE-2026-31802

# picomatch: ReDoS false positive for dev-authored patterns
CVE-2026-33671
